'''Kitarou''' (きたろう, Kitarou) is an enemy appearing in the [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kitarou
|image = E 458.png
|appearance = [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000円 - 3,950円
}}

==Enemy==
Kitarou has low overall stats (excluding range), and his [[Slow|slow]] isn't something to be feared about as it only lasts for two seconds.

==Strategy==
As usual, use anything that can outrange this enemy. If for any reason the slow effect makes you think he is a threat, bring [[Cat Units]] that are [[:Category:Cats with Slow Immunity|Immune to Slow]].

